  "title": "Q1 recap: Scaling flexibility across the ecosystem",
  "summary": "If Q4 was about launching Flex, Q1 has been about scaling with customers and partners. As more energy retailers move from early pilots to operational programs, the focus is shifting. It is less about whether flexibility works, and more about how to run programs reliably across growing portfolios of devices and markets. This quarter reflects that shift.",
